00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:18.338
WORDS OF PSALM 19. THE HEAVENS

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:21.207
ARE TELLING THE GLORY OF GOD AND

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:24.377
THEIR EXPANSE IS DECLARING THE

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:28.648
WORK OF GOD'S HANDS. THERE IS NO

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:31.784
SPEECH, NOR ARE THERE WORDS.

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:34.954
THEIR VOICE IS NOT HEARD. YET

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.189
THEIR MUSIC GOES OUT THROUGH ALL

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:37.824
THE EARTH AND THEIR UTTERANCES

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:40.193
TO THE END OF THE WORLD. THE LAW

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.196
OF THE LORD IS PERFECT,

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:45.665
RESTORING THE SOUL. THE PRECEPTS

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:48.468
OF THE LORD ARE RIGHT. REJOICING

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:52.639
THE HEART. BUT WHO CAN DISCERN

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:57.277
THEIR OWN WEAKNESSES? ACQUIT US,

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:58.578
OH LORD, FROM OUR HIDDEN FAULTS.

00:02:58.645 --> 00:03:01.114
LET OUR FEARS NOT HAVE DOMINION

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:05.919
OVER US. THEN SHALL WE BECOME A

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:08.588
BENEFICIAL PRESENCE FREELY AND

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:11.691
FULLY SURRENDERED TO YOUR LOVE.

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:15.428
LOVING GOD MAY THE WORDS OF OUR

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:17.163
MOUTHS AND THE MEDITATIONS OF

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.999
OUR HEARTS BE ACCEPTABLE IN YOUR

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:23.670
SIGHT THIS DAY. AMEN THANK YOU,

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:27.607
SISTER MICHELLE. SENATORS, STAFF

00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:30.777
AND GUESTS, PLEASE JOIN ME IN

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:31.844
THE PLEDGE OF ALLEGIANCE. I

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:33.613
PLEDGE ALLEGIANCE TO THE FLAG OF

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.648
THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA,

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:37.483
AND TO THE REPUBLIC FOR WHICH IT

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.787
STANDS. ONE NATION UNDER GOD,

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:41.821
INDIVISIBLE, WITH LIBERTY AND

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:54.067
JUSTICE FOR ALL. THIS WILL. ALL

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:57.503
RIGHT. WELL, LET ME JUST SAY

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.504
WELCOME THIS AFTERNOON TO

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:00.273
